// the original scope-check above only asked "what does <print> itself pull
// in", never "what pulls <print> in, and what runs after it in the same
// translation unit". A bare #undef is translation-unit-global and outlives
// this header entirely -- <filesystem>'s own __filesystem/path.h includes
